(4663920, 673575, 44877, '<td valign="top">Love this - it''s full of life and action. The colors happen to all go well together. Even though it''s busy, there''s a good flow.</td>', 'Love this - it''s full of life and action. The colors happen to all go well together. Even though it''s busy, there''s a good flow.', '2008-04-28 22:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663923, 673542, 58457, '<td valign="top">did you sneak into my house to take this picture?  pretty much spot on.</td>', 'did you sneak into my house to take this picture?  pretty much spot on.', '2008-04-28 22:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663924, 673573, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty, but I''m sure everyone is telling you what I will say: it has nothing to do with the challenge topic.</td>', 'This is very pretty, but I''m sure everyone is telling you what I will say: it has nothing to do with the challenge topic.', '2008-04-28 22:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663925, 673222, 73564, '<td valign="top">Very Interesting!</td>', 'Very Interesting!', '2008-04-28 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663928, 673317, 44877, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, but it''s a bit dark and dull.</td>', 'I like the composition, but it''s a bit dark and dull.', '2008-04-28 22:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663930, 673602, 44877, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.</td>', 'Cute idea.', '2008-04-28 22:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663939, 673166, 44877, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a kick. Love all the attention you put into this photo. Aside from the fabulous idea, it''s a bit too noisy. Nonetheless 7 for the amazing effort.</td>', 'Wow - what a kick. Love all the attention you put into this photo. Aside from the fabulous idea, it''s a bit too noisy. Nonetheless 7 for the amazing effort.', '2008-04-28 22:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663943, 673186, 44877, '<td valign="top">Excellent. <br/> <br/>Love the crop with focus on what counts.</td>', 'Excellent.  Love the crop with focus on what counts.', '2008-04-28 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663944, 673482, 44877, '<td valign="top">So funny! Love the perspective.</td>', 'So funny! Love the perspective.', '2008-04-28 22:22:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663947, 673350, 44877, '<td valign="top">Lovely tones.</td>', 'Lovely tones.', '2008-04-28 22:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663948, 673498, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is amazing - like he''s performing a magic trick and everyone is watching. Excellent catch.</td>', 'This is amazing - like he''s performing a magic trick and everyone is watching. Excellent catch.', '2008-04-28 22:23:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663953, 673277, 44877, '<td valign="top">This is kinda cool in its ghostly appearance. I''m certain it will be underappreciated, but I really like it.</td>', 'This is kinda cool in its ghostly appearance. I''m certain it will be underappreciated, but I really like it.', '2008-04-28 22:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4663954, 673545, 44877, '<td valign="top">This has excellent potential - however it''s out of focus and pretty noisy.</td>', 'This has excellent potential - however it''s out of focus and pretty noisy.', '2008-04-28 22:25:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664124, 673166, 18563, '<td valign="top">Wow, Very creative!</td>', 'Wow, Very creative!', '2008-04-28 23:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664125, 673541, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Narrow DOF seems to detract from the image rather than enhance it.</td>', 'Great shot!  Narrow DOF seems to detract from the image rather than enhance it.', '2008-04-28 23:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664126, 673353, 18563, '<td valign="top">Cool effect! colors seem a little off though</td>', 'Cool effect! colors seem a little off though', '2008-04-29 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664127, 673350, 18563, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites! Simple, clean...great shot!</td>', 'One of my favorites! Simple, clean...great shot!', '2008-04-29 00:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664129, 673217, 91496, '<td valign="top">Great asymetry and colors.  A little too much glare on some levels.</td>', 'Great asymetry and colors.  A little too much glare on some levels.', '2008-04-29 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664131, 673316, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Maybe a little more angle to see his face and perhaps more green grass color.</td>', 'Cute.  Maybe a little more angle to see his face and perhaps more green grass color.', '2008-04-29 00:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664132, 673371, 18563, '<td valign="top">Nice capture to the both of you!</td>', 'Nice capture to the both of you!', '2008-04-29 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664135, 673567, 18563, '<td valign="top">not sure whats going on here but i really like it! Nice!</td>', 'not sure whats going on here but i really like it! Nice!', '2008-04-29 00:06:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664136, 673444, 18563, '<td valign="top">Haha!!! They just don''t allow us to have this much fun anymore! Oh, lawn darts...</td>', 'Haha!!! They just don''t allow us to have this much fun anymore! Oh, lawn darts...', '2008-04-29 00:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664137, 673222, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice photo.  Like the idea, but might be little busy.  Reflections are present in 3 windows and two pairs of glasses.  Sideways knights look a little odd.</td>', 'Nice photo.  Like the idea, but might be little busy.  Reflections are present in 3 windows and two pairs of glasses.  Sideways knights look a little odd.', '2008-04-29 00:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664143, 673575, 91496, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.  I love all the facial expressions.  The 3 fences make the backdrop an eyesore, but what can you do.</td>', 'Very good capture.  I love all the facial expressions.  The 3 fences make the backdrop an eyesore, but what can you do.', '2008-04-29 00:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664148, 671894, 91496, '<td valign="top">Nice freeze of the action.  The backwards play (due to a throwing error to the backstop or similar) kind of detracts from the impact.</td>', 'Nice freeze of the action.  The backwards play (due to a throwing error to the backstop or similar) kind of detracts from the impact.', '2008-04-29 00:14:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664196, 672516, 12661, '<td valign="top">I have nothing negative to say about the photograph itself as far as technical merit. It is all very well done, lit, and composed. Subject wise, however, I would have gone with a straight flush instead of four aces. Basically, the king, although needed to complete the hand, doesn''t play any role. With the straight flush, all the cards would have had a meaning.</td>', 'I have nothing negative to say about the photograph itself as far as technical merit. It is all very well done, lit, and composed. Subject wise, however, I would have gone with a straight flush instead of four aces. Basically, the king, although needed to complete the hand, doesn''t play any role. With the straight flush, all the cards would have had a meaning.', '2008-04-29 00:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664198, 673011, 12661, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit harsh and the background is cluttered, taking away contrast from the subjects. Perhaps by taking the photograph while the were passing through the shade of a trees or a bridge could have improved the lighting. As far as the clutter, narrowing the field to just one or two lone runners would make it easier to ensure a clear definition between the subjects and the background.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit harsh and the background is cluttered, taking away contrast from the subjects. Perhaps by taking the photograph while the were passing through the shade of a trees or a bridge could have improved the lighting. As far as the clutter, narrowing the field to just one or two lone runners would make it easier to ensure a clear definition between the subjects and the background.', '2008-04-29 01:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664209, 673291, 12661, '<td valign="top">Holy cow, they''re not playing with toys there. Nice capture of the moment of impact. The splinters flying through the air really help make the photo.</td>', 'Holy cow, they''re not playing with toys there. Nice capture of the moment of impact. The splinters flying through the air really help make the photo.', '2008-04-29 01:18:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664213, 673517, 12661, '<td valign="top">Leaving the torso and legs of one of the players takes a lot away from the composition. I think the image would be better with a top down view showing only hands, string, and ground.</td>', 'Leaving the torso and legs of one of the players takes a lot away from the composition. I think the image would be better with a top down view showing only hands, string, and ground.', '2008-04-29 01:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664225, 672395, 26001, '<td valign="top">absolutely stunning. the light is just enough and at all right places. should be a strong podium contender.</td>', 'absolutely stunning. the light is just enough and at all right places. should be a strong podium contender.', '2008-04-29 01:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664227, 673541, 12661, '<td valign="top">I could definitely see this image being used in a magazine or newspaper article about steroids in the MLB.</td>', 'I could definitely see this image being used in a magazine or newspaper article about steroids in the MLB.', '2008-04-29 01:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664230, 672806, 12661, '<td valign="top">The subject is de-emphasized by being placed against the teammates in the background. I would prefer to see her against a uniform background such as the field so that there is a clear definition of the subject. Alternatively, reducing the depth of field so that the dugout is heavily out of focus would also work nicely.</td>', 'The subject is de-emphasized by being placed against the teammates in the background. I would prefer to see her against a uniform background such as the field so that there is a clear definition of the subject. Alternatively, reducing the depth of field so that the dugout is heavily out of focus would also work nicely.', '2008-04-29 01:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664237, 672697, 12661, '<td valign="top">Strong vibrant colors, nice use of depth of field to emphasize the pitcher, crisp clean focus, excellent composition, and a great expression on his face. A very well done image.</td>', 'Strong vibrant colors, nice use of depth of field to emphasize the pitcher, crisp clean focus, excellent composition, and a great expression on his face. A very well done image.', '2008-04-29 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664277, 673510, 69368, '<td valign="top">oh, this is a wonderful shot! Very good focus! Like the naturally colors, too.Would also be a high-scorer in free-study</td>', 'oh, this is a wonderful shot! Very good focus! Like the naturally colors, too.Would also be a high-scorer in free-study', '2008-04-29 02:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664287, 673310, 12661, '<td valign="top">I am a bit thrown off by the rotation of this image. I would expect the line of kites to go from the bottom up as opposed to top done. I am still debating as to whether it is simply disorienting or an interesting perspective that I have yet to open my mind to. I will pass on voting and come back to it later with a fresh mind.</td>', 'I am a bit thrown off by the rotation of this image. I would expect the line of kites to go from the bottom up as opposed to top done. I am still debating as to whether it is simply disorienting or an interesting perspective that I have yet to open my mind to. I will pass on voting and come back to it later with a fresh mind.', '2008-04-29 02:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664288, 673166, 12661, '<td valign="top">Hey!!! Acronyms are NOT allowed in scrabble.</td>', 'Hey!!! Acronyms are NOT allowed in scrabble.', '2008-04-29 02:41:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664294, 673550, 89940, '<td valign="top">I really like the DOF with the blurred foreground and sharp background. The lighting is overall good, however it would be better if the top of the background king was better lit. The reflections on the chess board are distracting, looks like they could have been avoided by making your light source bigger, either by a large diffusion sheet or by moving the light closer.</td>', 'I really like the DOF with the blurred foreground and sharp background. The lighting is overall good, however it would be better if the top of the background king was better lit. The reflections on the chess board are distracting, looks like they could have been avoided by making your light source bigger, either by a large diffusion sheet or by moving the light closer.', '2008-04-29 02:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664295, 672293, 89940, '<td valign="top">Great lighting</td>', 'Great lighting', '2008-04-29 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664297, 673502, 89940, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.</td>', 'Very nice lighting.', '2008-04-29 02:49:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664300, 672875, 89940, '<td valign="top">The lighting is ok but not great. The colors seem a little washed out.</td>', 'The lighting is ok but not great. The colors seem a little washed out.', '2008-04-29 02:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664302, 673602, 89940, '<td valign="top">The wrinkles in the background a distracting, might be better with a shallower DOF so the background is OOF or even less lighting on the background.<br/> <br/>BTW Your is mispelled. Should be you''re. Don''t worry I won''t deduct points for that. ;)</td>', 'The wrinkles in the background a distracting, might be better with a shallower DOF so the background is OOF or even less lighting on the background. BTW Your is mispelled. Should be you''re. Don''t worry I won''t deduct points for that. ;)', '2008-04-29 02:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664348, 673482, 93049, '<td valign="top">great subject, maybe pincers sharper</td>', 'great subject, maybe pincers sharper', '2008-04-29 03:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664353, 673473, 49109, '<td valign="top">How do you play it without fingers?<br/>Good focus and DOF; nice muted colors; crop at bottom is a bit tight; overall too noisy.</td>', 'How do you play it without fingers?Good focus and DOF; nice muted colors; crop at bottom is a bit tight; overall too noisy.', '2008-04-29 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664356, 673410, 49109, '<td valign="top">DOF is a bit shallow, at least the dog should have been in focus, too.  the border enhances the impression of softness. lighting is a bit harsh</td>', 'DOF is a bit shallow, at least the dog should have been in focus, too.  the border enhances the impression of softness. lighting is a bit harsh', '2008-04-29 04:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664358, 671844, 49109, '<td valign="top">good capture, well seen that a shadow sometimes makes an image. overall hue is a bit on the red side.  i find the green border somehow distracting</td>', 'good capture, well seen that a shadow sometimes makes an image. overall hue is a bit on the red side.  i find the green border somehow distracting', '2008-04-29 04:17:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664359, 673537, 49109, '<td valign="top">obviously not an unusual scene where you are living :) Nice cpature, had cropped off the tree, though</td>', 'obviously not an unusual scene where you are living :) Nice cpature, had cropped off the tree, though', '2008-04-29 04:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664362, 672648, 49109, '<td valign="top">nice idea and good POV. lighting could be much enhanced; too harsh on her face, the spilled light reflections on the bed are distracting.</td>', 'nice idea and good POV. lighting could be much enhanced; too harsh on her face, the spilled light reflections on the bed are distracting.', '2008-04-29 04:21:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664364, 673510, 49109, '<td valign="top">very well captured, excellent focus, crop and natural colors. the foreground bokeh is not as nice, a lager aperture (or better lens) had helped</td>', 'very well captured, excellent focus, crop and natural colors. the foreground bokeh is not as nice, a lager aperture (or better lens) had helped', '2008-04-29 04:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664366, 673166, 49109, '<td valign="top">FSTOP is not a word, cheater!<br/>Very nice idea, like the muted colors. perspective is a bit skewed.</td>', 'FSTOP is not a word, cheater!Very nice idea, like the muted colors. perspective is a bit skewed.', '2008-04-29 04:25:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664369, 673521, 49109, '<td valign="top">it''s a cliché anyway, but would have been much more interesting with at least one arrow in the board</td>', 'it''s a cliché anyway, but would have been much more interesting with at least one arrow in the board', '2008-04-29 04:27:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664371, 673076, 49109, '<td valign="top">play? yes. game? no.</td>', 'play? yes. game? no.', '2008-04-29 04:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4664376, 673317, 49109, '<td valign="top">overall way too dark; DOF is too shallow, focus is too far in the back but should have been either on the boardwalk or on the first dice</td>', 'overall way too dark; DOF is too shallow, focus is too far in the back but should have been either on the boardwalk or on the first dice', '2008-04-29 04:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
