(4668129, 673031, 30982, '<td valign="top">Man, either those things are TINY or that dog is huge.  Possibly both.  Neat idea - the blobs in the background aren''t providing anything useful to the shot, though.</td>', 'Man, either those things are TINY or that dog is huge.  Possibly both.  Neat idea - the blobs in the background aren''t providing anything useful to the shot, though.', '2008-04-30 15:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
