(4668134, 673056, 30982, '<td valign="top">Nice setup shot - the reflection in the driver is cool.  Perhaps just a hair too bright on the top of the ball.</td>', 'Nice setup shot - the reflection in the driver is cool.  Perhaps just a hair too bright on the top of the ball.', '2008-04-30 15:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668137, 672791, 30982, '<td valign="top">There''s something very captivating about this - I like the pose, the scoreboard in the backdrop, the ball in the shot.  The face almost looks unreal in a way, though I can''t quite figure out why.</td>', 'There''s something very captivating about this - I like the pose, the scoreboard in the backdrop, the ball in the shot.  The face almost looks unreal in a way, though I can''t quite figure out why.', '2008-04-30 15:10:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668138, 673508, 30982, '<td valign="top">Without even seeing the title first, I was immediately taken by the focus of the young man.  I like the faded color, too.</td>', 'Without even seeing the title first, I was immediately taken by the focus of the young man.  I like the faded color, too.', '2008-04-30 15:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668139, 673265, 30982, '<td valign="top">This was always a big hit on the TVs in dining halls in Kuwait.  We had a lot of workers from India and apparently cricket is huge there.  I never did figure out the meaning, the scoring or the objective.  But they are very snappy dressers.  Great shot of the game.</td>', 'This was always a big hit on the TVs in dining halls in Kuwait.  We had a lot of workers from India and apparently cricket is huge there.  I never did figure out the meaning, the scoring or the objective.  But they are very snappy dressers.  Great shot of the game.', '2008-04-30 15:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668142, 671894, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very good catch of the action.</td>', 'Very good catch of the action.', '2008-04-30 15:13:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668144, 673316, 30982, '<td valign="top">When the helmet is that big, you gotta wonder how they see.  Nice shot - very good detail, love the soft light.</td>', 'When the helmet is that big, you gotta wonder how they see.  Nice shot - very good detail, love the soft light.', '2008-04-30 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4668145, 672374, 30982, '<td valign="top">Sad, isn''t it?  Well depicted.</td>', 'Sad, isn''t it?  Well depicted.', '2008-04-30 15:14:52.000000', NULL, 1),
