(4668671, 673444, 24846, '<td valign="top">Lol. My 12 y/o son asked me what lawn darts where the other day. Very relalistic pose and blood. Good luck.</td>', 'Lol. My 12 y/o son asked me what lawn darts where the other day. Very relalistic pose and blood. Good luck.', '2008-04-30 17:55:05.000000', NULL, 1),
