(4671666, 673483, 52500, '<td valign="top">I like the color treatment here, and the image feels well balanced.  I think I probably would have added a bit of a vignette (it just seems like it needs one).</td>', 'I like the color treatment here, and the image feels well balanced.  I think I probably would have added a bit of a vignette (it just seems like it needs one).', '2008-05-01 14:55:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671672, 673567, 52500, '<td valign="top">Cool image!  Great tones, and the curve of white really draws my eye through the whole thing.  Your title is cheesy, but no biggie.</td>', 'Cool image!  Great tones, and the curve of white really draws my eye through the whole thing.  Your title is cheesy, but no biggie.', '2008-05-01 14:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671753, 673245, 52500, '<td valign="top">I wonder how many people actually know what this is.  I used to be a juggler, and I played with all kinds of fun toys!  I haven''t picked one up in a long time, and I was never any good anyway.  Great shot, and it certainly connected with this viewer!  If I had to change anything, I would probably give it a bit more contrast.  Nice one!</td>', 'I wonder how many people actually know what this is.  I used to be a juggler, and I played with all kinds of fun toys!  I haven''t picked one up in a long time, and I was never any good anyway.  Great shot, and it certainly connected with this viewer!  If I had to change anything, I would probably give it a bit more contrast.  Nice one!', '2008-05-01 15:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4671778, 673122, 52500, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  Sure, it''s a game, but there isn''t much else going on here.  The tiles in front seem kinda washed out as well. 5</td>', 'Not a bad shot, but it doesn''t really hold my interest.  Sure, it''s a game, but there isn''t much else going on here.  The tiles in front seem kinda washed out as well. 5', '2008-05-01 15:07:58.000000', NULL, 1),
