(4680995, 672395, 51793, '<td valign="top">I am very surprised that this took the blue and got a 7.1 with the image being so dark. Don''t get me wrong the items in the picture are good but I think it''s way too dark.<br/> <br/>Congratulations on your first blue. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-05-05 07:15:30.</i></td>', 'I am very surprised that this took the blue and got a 7.1 with the image being so dark. Don''t get me wrong the items in the picture are good but I think it''s way too dark. Congratulations on your first blue. ', '2008-05-05 08:03:04.000000', '2008-05-05 08:15:30.000000', 0),
(4680996, 673504, 68514, '<td valign="top">You are into the action. Well done, great DOF and BW. Congrats for HM Enzo. Ciao :)</td>', 'You are into the action. Well done, great DOF and BW. Congrats for HM Enzo. Ciao :)', '2008-05-05 08:03:28.000000', NULL, 0),
