(4681032, 673504, 48228, '<td valign="top">SO, SO close Enzo, and a wonderful sporting image here thats for sure..... A great result, but I would have liked to see this one with a ribbon.....</td>', 'SO, SO close Enzo, and a wonderful sporting image here thats for sure..... A great result, but I would have liked to see this one with a ribbon.....', '2008-05-05 08:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(4681033, 672395, 92383, '<td valign="top">Thought I had commented during the Challenge.  This was the only 10 I gave.  I know it is a little dark but I like it - even though convention states it should be lighter.<br/> <br/>I think darker works in this image. Of course it is a little risky whenever we adventure away from the center.  At the same time, the safe center can be boring and predictable too.</td>', 'Thought I had commented during the Challenge.  This was the only 10 I gave.  I know it is a little dark but I like it - even though convention states it should be lighter. I think darker works in this image. Of course it is a little risky whenever we adventure away from the center.  At the same time, the safe center can be boring and predictable too.', '2008-05-05 08:24:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4681035, 673566, 48228, '<td valign="top">Awesome, awesome, awesome..... <br/>I love it, and this is a great result for you..... <br/> <br/>The processing is <b>TOPS</b> IMO, and I love the color tones very much..... <br/>A great score for you, for an equally great image.....</td>', 'Awesome, awesome, awesome..... I love it, and this is a great result for you.....  The processing is TOPS IMO, and I love the color tones very much..... A great score for you, for an equally great image.....', '2008-05-05 08:25:01.000000', NULL, 0),
