(4681193, 673590, 67697, '<td valign="top">I thought maybe this would have finished a little higher.  I thought the selective desat was perfect for this!  Beautiful photo.</td>', 'I thought maybe this would have finished a little higher.  I thought the selective desat was perfect for this!  Beautiful photo.', '2008-05-05 09:19:48.000000', NULL, 0),
