(4696098, 673484, 91776, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by freakin_hilarious:</b></div><hr/><i> Sorry, this doesn''t do it for me at all.  Just because you use the word game in the title and have a checkerboard under the water doesn''t make it a game.  This shot is also way overdone and quite boring for me now.  You also only used 56% of the maximum pixels available in an advanced editing challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>It''s waterchess</td>', 'Originally posted by freakin_hilarious: Sorry, this doesn''t do it for me at all.  Just because you use the word game in the title and have a checkerboard under the water doesn''t make it a game.  This shot is also way overdone and quite boring for me now.  You also only used 56% of the maximum pixels available in an advanced editing challenge.   It''s waterchess', '2008-05-12 05:38:17.000000', NULL, 0),
